    "detailed_description": "<br>What would happen if we put the theropods together and looked for the coolest of them all? Choose your favorite dinosaur and find out by competing in...<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521510/extras/a702daf17f8be97e42c83a22608fa371.avif?t=1706714381\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LOCAL AND REMOTE PLAY MULTIPLAYER FUN!</strong></h2><br>Immerse yourself in the fun whether alone or with friends; Up to 4 players can enjoy the multiplayer experience locally or through Steam Remote Play. Discover the thrills of <strong>\u201cTreasure Bridge\u201d</strong> mode which offers a wide variety of our mini-games!<br><br><strong>&quot;Treasure Bridge&quot; Mode</strong><br><br>Get ready for the ultimate competition! Take on your friends in an exciting race towards the magnificent treasure. Only a skilled player will overcome each challenge of our mini-games, build their bridge first and be crowned the undisputed winner! Do you have what it takes to claim the treasure?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521510/extras/68cb4da80ef5e728ce7e8c51144595b9.poster.avif?t=1706714381\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521510/extras/68cb4da80ef5e728ce7e8c51144595b9.webm?t=1706714381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521510/extras/68cb4da80ef5e728ce7e8c51144595b9.mp4?t=1706714381\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>VARIETY OF MINI-GAMES!</strong></h2><br>Challenge your friends in a variety of exciting mini-games that will only increase! Survive the great rain of rocks in <i>&quot;Eruption&quot;</i>! or avoid the dangerous Triceratops in <i>&quot;Stampede&quot;</i>! The fun never stops in <strong>PartySaur: Dino Mayhem</strong>, so come and show off your skill and dexterity!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521510/extras/1056369b4d20272d189cfa4ef24aea01.poster.avif?t=1706714381\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521510/extras/1056369b4d20272d189cfa4ef24aea01.webm?t=1706714381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521510/extras/1056369b4d20272d189cfa4ef24aea01.mp4?t=1706714381\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>VARIETY OF CHARACTERS!</strong></h2><br>Embark on the exciting adventures of <strong>Fang Island</strong> with our charismatic, tender and unique characters that we have for you. Choose your favorite and join the wildest and funniest competition you've ever experienced in <strong>PartySaur: Dino Mayhem</strong>!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521510/extras/d6796ae86b62abac5026ea6d27500f9a.avif?t=1706714381\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNIQUE STYLES!</strong></h2><br>Explore your inner dinosaur and unleash all your style. Do you want a duck as a hat? We have it! Are you looking for an elegant suit to stand out among your friends? Of course! At PartySaur you can find that and much more to personalize your experience and shine in each competition!",
    "about_the_game": "<br>What would happen if we put the theropods together and looked for the coolest of them all? Choose your favorite dinosaur and find out by competing in...<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521510/extras/a702daf17f8be97e42c83a22608fa371.avif?t=1706714381\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LOCAL AND REMOTE PLAY MULTIPLAYER FUN!</strong></h2><br>Immerse yourself in the fun whether alone or with friends; Up to 4 players can enjoy the multiplayer experience locally or through Steam Remote Play. Discover the thrills of <strong>\u201cTreasure Bridge\u201d</strong> mode which offers a wide variety of our mini-games!<br><br><strong>&quot;Treasure Bridge&quot; Mode</strong><br><br>Get ready for the ultimate competition! Take on your friends in an exciting race towards the magnificent treasure. Only a skilled player will overcome each challenge of our mini-games, build their bridge first and be crowned the undisputed winner! Do you have what it takes to claim the treasure?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521510/extras/68cb4da80ef5e728ce7e8c51144595b9.poster.avif?t=1706714381\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521510/extras/68cb4da80ef5e728ce7e8c51144595b9.webm?t=1706714381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521510/extras/68cb4da80ef5e728ce7e8c51144595b9.mp4?t=1706714381\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>VARIETY OF MINI-GAMES!</strong></h2><br>Challenge your friends in a variety of exciting mini-games that will only increase! Survive the great rain of rocks in <i>&quot;Eruption&quot;</i>! or avoid the dangerous Triceratops in <i>&quot;Stampede&quot;</i>! The fun never stops in <strong>PartySaur: Dino Mayhem</strong>, so come and show off your skill and dexterity!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521510/extras/1056369b4d20272d189cfa4ef24aea01.poster.avif?t=1706714381\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521510/extras/1056369b4d20272d189cfa4ef24aea01.webm?t=1706714381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521510/extras/1056369b4d20272d189cfa4ef24aea01.mp4?t=1706714381\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>VARIETY OF CHARACTERS!</strong></h2><br>Embark on the exciting adventures of <strong>Fang Island</strong> with our charismatic, tender and unique characters that we have for you. Choose your favorite and join the wildest and funniest competition you've ever experienced in <strong>PartySaur: Dino Mayhem</strong>!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2521510/extras/d6796ae86b62abac5026ea6d27500f9a.avif?t=1706714381\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNIQUE STYLES!</strong></h2><br>Explore your inner dinosaur and unleash all your style. Do you want a duck as a hat? We have it! Are you looking for an elegant suit to stand out among your friends? Of course! At PartySaur you can find that and much more to personalize your experience and shine in each competition!",
